# Evaitec Logo Generation Plan

This plan outlines the process for generating high-quality, premium logo variations for **Evaitec** (evaitec.com), an AI software, technology, automation, and consultancy firm.

## Goal
Generate a set of premium logo options that represent the intersection of **AI/Technology** and **Nature/Growth** (Bio-Digital Hybrid).

## Design Strategy
The design will draw inspiration from existing concepts found in [last.png](file:///c:/projects/evaitec/assets/logos/last.png) and [logo-variations.html](file:///c:/projects/evaitec/assets/logos/logo-variations.html), focusing on:
- **Symbolism**: Stylized "@" and "i" integration, microchip patterns, infinity symbols, and leafy/root-like organic elements.
- **Aesthetic**: Glassmorphism, 3D depth, soft glows, and clean kinetic typography.
- **Typography**: Professional sans-serif (varying weights between "eVai" and "Tec").
- **Colors**:
  - **Deep Navy** (`#0D1B2E`)
  - **Forest Green** (`#2d6a4f`)
  - **Mint Green** (`#52b788`)
  - **Tech Blue/Electric Teal** (`#0077B6`, `#00b4d8`)
  - **Sky Glow** (`#90e0ef`)

## Proposed Actions

### 1. Research & Prompt Engineering
- Analyze the successful elements of the 10 SVG variations in [logo-variations.html](file:///c:/projects/evaitec/assets/logos/logo-variations.html).
- Craft detailed prompts for `generate_image` to produce 3D rendered, glassmorphic logos.

### 2. Logo Variation Generation
I will generate several variations:
- **[NEW] [evaitec_logo_v1.png](file:///c:/projects/evaitec/assets/logos/evaitec_logo_v1.png)**: A high-end 3D glassmorphic logo featuring a bio-digital infinity symbol.
- **[NEW] [evaitec_logo_v2.png](file:///c:/projects/evaitec/assets/logos/evaitec_logo_v2.png)**: A technical concept focusing on a microchip "@" symbol with organic growth elements.
- **[NEW] [evaitec_logo_v3.png](file:///c:/projects/evaitec/assets/logos/evaitec_logo_v3.png)**: A minimalist, premium version for corporate branding.

### 3. Verification & Refinement
- Present the generated logos to the user.
- Refine based on feedback (colors, symbolism, typography).

## Verification Plan
### Manual Verification
- View the generated images to ensure they meet the quality and aesthetic standards.
- Check if the colors and symbols match the "Evaitec" brand identity described in [PROJECT_HANDOFF.md](file:///c:/projects/evaitec/PROJECT_HANDOFF.md).
- Ensure the typography is legible and professional.
